    "text": "Excess-sludge controller on the clarifier, checked twice a day: while the MLSS in the aerated\nreactor is above 4200 g/m\u00b3 the WAS pump draws 70 m\u00b3/d, above 3800 g/m\u00b3 45 m\u00b3/d, below\n3000 g/m\u00b3 15 m\u00b3/d; otherwise the 29.6 m\u00b3/d sized for a 15 d sludge age. It holds the tank\nat 4100-4200 g/m\u00b3; without it the MLSS climbs to about 5400 g/m\u00b3.",
